  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your devastating blows terrorize your enemies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Menacing Blow.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Add your mythic tier as a bonus on Intimidate checks you make when using this feat. If you exceed the DC by 10 or more, the target becomes frightened for rather than shaken. If the target is a non-mythic creature, it becomes shaken for 1 round even on a failed Intimidate check.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc226\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
